// Engine Sim V0.1.14A
// 1936 Buick 60 120 @ 3200
// Created by oror 2026

// Buick
// Century Series 60 — 1936–1942
// Roadmaster Series 80 — 1936–1939
// Roadmaster Series 70 — 1940–1942, 1946–1952
// Limited Series 90 — 1936–1942
// Limited Series 80 — 1940

// 1939 Buick Eight Convertible L.A. Noire
// 1939 Buick Eight Coupe L.A. Noire
// 1947 Buick Ambulance L.A. Noire

// Wright — Coupe, Fordor, Coupe Gangster

